                                                "sense_id": "b6d8d36b-5cf0-350f-bca4-b7afdb8c853b",
                                                "text": "As of April 26, the US ranked 22nd in the number of tests performed per capita, according to the Organization for Economic Co-operation and Development (OECD)."
